---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/about-cover.jpeg";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Software Developer, Open Source Contributor, and Cloud Native Specialist."
	pubDate={new Date("July 05 2026")}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hey there, I'm Abhigyan! I'm a Software Engineer and Open Source
		Contributor building scalable and intelligent AI-native systems. I love
		geeking out over Tech, AI/ML, and everything Cloud Native.
	</p>
	<p>
		My open-source work is currently focused on <strong
			>Kubernetes SIG Scheduling</strong
		>. I contribute to the <a
			href="https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kueue"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener noreferrer">Kueue</a
		>
		project, focusing on <strong>KueueViz</strong>. My recent work includes
		fortifying secure deployments, mitigating DoS vulnerabilities via HTTP
		and WebSocket safeguards, resolving dashboard crashes, and enforcing
		container security best practices.
	</p>

	<p>
		Previously, I was a FullStack Developer at ArthurSpaces. My go-to tech
		stack usually involves Go, TypeScript, Python, and React Native, running
		on top of Kubernetes and Argo. I'm also a huge believer in learning and
		building in public, so this blog is my little corner of the internet to
		share my technical deep dives, experiments, and thoughts on modern
		infrastructure.
	</p>

	<p>
		When I'm not deploying workloads or tinkering with new system
		architectures, you can usually find me unwinding with old American and
		European classic movies, or occasionally catching up on some anime.
	</p>

	<p>
		I'm always down to chat about tech, brainstorm ideas, or discuss
		opportunities. Say hi on <a
			href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhigyan-mohanta/"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a
		>, follow my ramblings on <a
			href="https://x.com/MohantaAbhigyan"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a
		>, or check out my repos on <a
			href="https://github.com/ABHIGYAN-MOHANTA"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a
		>!
	</p>
</Layout>
